    "description": "howToPrayItidalInstruction"
  },
  "howToPrayMiddleTashahhudInstruction": "Sit after the 2nd Rak'ah. Raise your right index finger when saying the Shahada. For 3 and 4 Rak'ah prayers, stand again after this sitting.",
